# First quarter

Revenue for the quarter was 35200, and profit
14700 after costs. The best month was
Mar, and the books closed on
2025-04-02.

Tax is charged at 20%, which comes to
2940.

## Months over target

A table can be shown where it is asked for:

| Month | Revenue | Profit |
| :---- | ------: | -----: |
| Feb   |   12000 |   5000 |
| Mar   |   13200 |   5700 |

## Targets

A document can hold sheets of its own. This block is a sheet like any other,
and it reads the one named at the top:

| Month | Goal | Profit | Over | Met   |
| :---- | ---: | -----: | ---: | :---- |
| Jan   | 4200 |   4000 | -200 | false |
| Feb   | 4500 |   5000 |  500 | true  |
| Mar   | 5000 |   5700 |  700 | true  |

2 of 3 months met
their goal. Written in code, `{{ 1 + 1 }}` is left as it is.
